  "title": "CMake: Create option for separate installation folders for Wireshark and Stratoshark",
  "description": "Windows and macOS have completely separate installers for Wireshark and Stratoshark, so they don't need a separate subfolder to put the application specific files.  Rather than make that functionality OS specific, create an option where the default is how the OS currently behaves\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
